# Perl's `\N{NAME}`, with Perl 5.40 as the oracle.
# Written by tools/corpus/make_name_vectors.py.
#
# Stored names, every NameAliases kind, the computed families at
# their range edges, and the spellings Perl refuses - a lower-case
# name, hyphens for spaces, a doubled space, an unknown name, and a
# name of the right shape for a range it does not fall in.
#
# Rows for characters Perl's UCD 17.0.0 does not have are left out:
# those are a version difference rather than a disagreement, the
# same skew unicode.md section 1 describes.
